== System Timer ==
The port uses the PIT timer for periodic interrupts.
At the moment, the timer uint must be initialized manually (<code>EE_pit_init()</code>), which sets up a default period of 1000 Hz.<br>
The rate can be changed using <code>EE_pit_set_periodic(EE_UINT16 rate_in_Hz)</code>.<br>
Please note: Due to hardware limitations, the minimal PIT rate is around 20 Hz.<br>
The following configuration options are currently not supported.<br>


